Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:25:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] P15A.1 Wave 2 (a): the reception seam, defaulting to 1
 (1361-E2 r1)

1355-A section 3.2 and section 8 item 5, commit (a):
- ReceptionInputs gains an optional competitionFactor. computeBoxOffice
  takes it as a trailing parameter that defaults to 1 and replaces the
  constant 1.0 of N11; a factor outside
  [1 - SHARED_MARKET_FACTOR_MAX_PENALTY, 1] throws. resolveReception
  passes inp.competitionFactor ?? 1.
- advanceHollywoodWeek takes an optional factor map and applies a
  release's factor at the rival reception site.

No caller supplies a factor yet, so every reception is bit-identical:
x * 1 = x in IEEE arithmetic, and the critic draw precedes the seam.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
